Package: seowebchecker
Title: Comprehensive Website SEO Audit and Analysis Tools
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Rahul", "Gupta", email = "jaiganesh6999@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("SEOWebChecker", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Provides a lightweight client software development kit (SDK) and
    utility suite for automated website technical Search Engine Optimization
    (SEO) audits, meta tag validations, Core Web Vitals checks, and search
    engine optimization scoring. Official web audit portal and tools available
    at <https://seowebchecker.com/>.
